<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Ommeren positive over 1997.</title>
<headline>Van Ommeren positive over 1997.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch shipping and tank storage firm Koninklijke van Ommeren NV said on Thursday it expected positive market developments in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;As for 1997, we expect Van Ommeren's main markets to continue to develop in a relatively positive way, and substantial investments in terminals and tankers will contribute for a full-year for the first time,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
